description:
Create lib/environment_objects.rs with pure data types:

- EnvironmentObject { id: Uuid, name: String, path: PathBuf, visible: bool, transform: Transform3D, textures_enabled: bool, meshes: Vec<MeshEntry> }
- MeshEntry { name: String, visible: bool }
- EnvironmentObjectStore resource (Vec<EnvironmentObject>, add/remove/get methods)
- Transform3D { position: [f32;3], rotation: [f32;3], scale: [f32;3] } (lib-side, no Bevy Transform)

Pure logic, no ECS. Testable.
